{"title": "拆開一則 SIP INVITE", "type": "content", "layout": "left_text_right_image", "background": "#F6F7F9", "elements": [{"type": "shape", "shape": "roundRect", "x": 600, "y": 60, "w": 620, "h": 330, "fill": "#0B1B2E"}, {"type": "text", "x": 624, "y": 84, "w": 580, "h": 290, "paragraphs": [{"spaceAfterPt": 8, "runs": [{"text": "① INVITE sip:208930000000002@ims.mnc093.mcc208.3gppnetwork.org SIP/2.0", "sizePt": 12, "bold": true, "color": "#E8742A", "font": "DejaVu Sans Mono"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 4, "runs": [{"text": "② Via: SIP/2.0/UDP 10.62.0.1:5060;branch=z9hG4bK...", "sizePt": 12, "color": "#FFFFFF", "font": "DejaVu Sans Mono"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 4, "runs": [{"text": "③ From: <sip:208930000000001@ims...>;tag=abc", "sizePt": 12, "color": "#FFFFFF", "font": "DejaVu Sans Mono"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 4, "runs": [{"text": "   To: <sip:208930000000002@ims...>", "sizePt": 12, "color": "#FFFFFF", "font": "DejaVu Sans Mono"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 4, "runs": [{"text": "   Call-ID: 12345@10.62.0.1", "sizePt": 12, "color": "#FFFFFF", "font": "DejaVu Sans Mono"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 4, "runs": [{"text": "   CSeq: 1 INVITE", "sizePt": 12, "color": "#FFFFFF", "font": "DejaVu Sans Mono"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 4, "runs": [{"text": "④ Contact: <sip:208930000000001@10.62.0.1:5060>", "sizePt": 12, "color": "#FFFFFF", "font": "DejaVu Sans Mono"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 18, "runs": [{"text": "   Content-Type: application/sdp", "sizePt": 12, "color": "#FFFFFF", "font": "DejaVu Sans Mono"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 4, "runs": [{"text": "⑤ v=0", "sizePt": 12, "color": "#C9D3E0", "font": "DejaVu Sans Mono"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 4, "runs": [{"text": "   c=IN IP4 10.62.0.1        ← 聲音送到這個 IP", "sizePt": 12, "color": "#C9D3E0", "font": "DejaVu Sans Mono"}]}, {"runs": [{"text": "   m=audio 6000 RTP/AVP 0    ← port 6000，PCMU", "sizePt": 12, "color": "#C9D3E0", "font": "DejaVu Sans Mono"}]}]}, {"type": "shape", "shape": "roundRect", "x": 600, "y": 410, "w": 620, "h": 176, "fill": "#FCEBDD", "valign": "middle", "paragraphs": [{"align": "left", "spaceAfterPt": 6, "runs": [{"text": "   IMS 版 SIP（TS 24.229）多了什麼", "sizePt": 15, "bold": true, "color": "#E8742A"}]}, {"align": "left", "spaceAfterPt": 4, "runs": [{"text": "   • Path / Service-Route：之後要經過的 proxy", "sizePt": 13, "color": "#14213D"}]}, {"align": "left", "spaceAfterPt": 4, "runs": [{"text": "   • P-Asserted-Identity：網路擔保的來電身分", "sizePt": 13, "color": "#14213D"}]}, {"align": "left", "spaceAfterPt": 4, "runs": [{"text": "   • P-Visited-Network-ID：漫遊政策用", "sizePt": 13, "color": "#14213D"}]}, {"align": "left", "runs": [{"text": "   • Authorization：AKA 答案（HTTP Digest 格式）", "sizePt": 13, "color": "#14213D"}]}]}, {"type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 56, "w": 510, "h": 64, "paragraphs": [{"runs": [{"text": "拆開一則 SIP INVITE", "sizePt": 34, "bold": true, "color": "#14213D"}]}]}, {"type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 136, "w": 510, "h": 450, "paragraphs": [{"spaceAfterPt": 2, "runs": [{"text": "① Request line", "sizePt": 16, "bold": true, "color": "#E8742A"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 12, "runs": [{"text": "動作＋對象（被叫的 IMPU），像 HTTP 的 GET 網址", "sizePt": 14, "color": "#14213D"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 2, "runs": [{"text": "② Via", "sizePt": 16, "bold": true, "color": "#14213D"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 12, "runs": [{"text": "回程路徑，每過一個 proxy 疊一層", "sizePt": 14, "color": "#14213D"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 2, "runs": [{"text": "③ From / To / Call-ID / CSeq", "sizePt": 16, "bold": true, "color": "#14213D"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 12, "runs": [{"text": "誰打給誰、是哪一通電話、這是第幾則訊息", "sizePt": 14, "color": "#14213D"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 2, "runs": [{"text": "④ Contact", "sizePt": 16, "bold": true, "color": "#14213D"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 12, "runs": [{"text": "之後找我的位址；註冊時 S-CSCF 記的就是它", "sizePt": 14, "color": "#14213D"}]}, {"spaceAfterPt": 2, "runs": [{"text": "⑤ 空行之後是 SDP body", "sizePt": 16, "bold": true, "color": "#0F4C81"}]}, {"runs": [{"text": "聲音的 IP、port、codec；P-CSCF 讀它來要 QoS", "sizePt": 14, "color": "#14213D"}]}]}, {"type": "shape", "shape": "roundRect", "x": 60, "y": 610, "w":